From: wangzlei <66336933+wangzlei@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 21:37:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] exp: ebpf drop-in prepares /sys/fs/bpf/otel for cwagent

OBI pins shared maps under /sys/fs/bpf/otel; /sys/fs/bpf is root-only. Without
this the unprivileged agent fails on a root-owned pin dir left by an earlier root
run, or runs with pinning disabled when the dir does not exist.
---
 packaging/dependencies/amazon-cloudwatch-agent-ebpf.conf | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/packaging/dependencies/amazon-cloudwatch-agent-ebpf.conf b/packaging/dependencies/amazon-cloudwatch-agent-ebpf.conf
index 4a598474..221eb446 100644
--- a/packaging/dependencies/amazon-cloudwatch-agent-ebpf.conf
+++ b/packaging/dependencies/amazon-cloudwatch-agent-ebpf.conf
@@ -13,3 +13,9 @@ LimitMEMLOCK=infinity
 # The agent writes logs/ and var/ and reads etc/ (written by the ctl as root).
 # "+" runs this one step as root.
 ExecStartPre=+/bin/chown -R cwagent:cwagent /opt/aws/amazon-cloudwatch-agent/logs /opt/aws/amazon-cloudwatch-agent/var /opt/aws/amazon-cloudwatch-agent/etc
+# OBI pins maps shared with other OTel eBPF components under /sys/fs/bpf/otel.
+# /sys/fs/bpf is root-only: prepare that one directory (and any pins a previous
+# root run left there) for cwagent, or OBI fails with "load pinned map: permission
+# denied" (existing root-owned dir) or runs with pinning disabled (no dir).
+ExecStartPre=+/bin/mkdir -p /sys/fs/bpf/otel
+ExecStartPre=+/bin/chown -R cwagent:cwagent /sys/fs/bpf/otel
